sequenceDiagram
  participant J as Journalist
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Ed as Editor
  participant Pub as Publisher
  participant AIA as AIA
  participant CAE as CAE

  J->>API: POST /auth/login
  API-->>J: session_token
  J->>API: POST /journalist/news (+evidence)
  J->>API: PUT /journalist/content/{id}/status submitted
  Ed->>API: GET /editor/queue
  Ed->>API: PUT /editor/content/{id}/approve
  Pub->>API: POST /publisher/articles/{id}/publish
  AIA->>API: GET /aia/performance
  AIA->>API: POST /aia/generate-story-pitch
  CAE->>API: POST /cae/adaptations
  CAE->>API: PUT /cae/adaptation-drafts/{id}/final
